  "description": "Taxi Hyperdrive is a fast-paced arcade game built around intense 10-minute runs. Jump into a futuristic hovering taxi and tear through a massive open city, picking up passengers and dropping them off before time runs out.\n\nRace across a futuristic metropolis made up of multiple themed districts, each offering unique routes, shortcuts and scoring opportunities.\n\nYour taxi hits extreme speeds, pulls off huge jumps and collects power-ups that boost earnings and add strategic depth.\n\nAfter each run, your score is uploaded to a global online leaderboard.\n\nFeatures:\n• Intense 10-minute arcade runs.\n• Large futuristic open city.\n• Hovering taxis, extreme speed and massive jumps.\n• Strategic power-ups.\n• Global online leaderboard.\n• 6 training missions.",
